    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4160141,
        4160198
      ],
      "value": "【LANGUAGE OVERRIDE】ALL output MUST be in English.\n\n",
      "index": 2
    },
    {
      "tag": "s",
      "fileRange": [
        4160198,
        4160199
      ],
      "value": "",
      "index": 3
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4160199,
        4160237
      ],
      "value": "You are a fact extraction specialist",
      "index": 4
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4160237,
        4160302
      ],
      "value": "Read the chapter text and extract EVERY observable fact change.",
      "index": 5
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4160302,
        4160949
      ],
      "value": "## Extraction Categories\n\n1. **Character actions**: Who did what, to whom, why\n2. **Location changes**: Who moved where, from where\n3. **Resource changes**: Items gained, lost, consumed, quantities\n4. **Relationship changes**: New encounters, trust/distrust shifts, alliances, betrayals\n5. **Emotional shifts**: Character mood before → after, trigger event\n6. **Information flow**: Who learned what, who is still unaware\n7. **Plot threads**: New mysteries planted, existing threads advanced, threads resolved\n8. **Time progression**: How much time passed, time markers mentioned\n9. **Physical state**: Injuries, healing, fatigue, power changes",
      "index": 6
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4160949,
        4161256
      ],
      "value": "## Rules\n\n- Extract from the TEXT ONLY — do not infer what might happen\n- Over-extract: if unsure whether something is significant, include it\n- Be specific: \"Lin Chen's left arm fractured\" not \"Lin Chen got hurt\"\n- Include chapter-internal time markers\n- Note which characters are present in each scene",
      "index": 7
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4161256,
        4161909
      ],
      "value": "=== OBSERVATIONS ===\n\n[CHARACTERS]\n- <name>: <action/state change> (scene: <location>)\n\n[LOCATIONS]\n- <character> moved from <A> to <B>\n\n[RESOURCES]\n- <character> gained/lost <item> (quantity: <n>)\n\n[RELATIONSHIPS]\n- <charA> → <charB>: <change description>\n\n[EMOTIONS]\n- <character>: <before> → <after> (trigger: <event>)\n\n[INFORMATION]\n- <character> learned: <fact> (source: <how>)\n- <character> still unaware of: <fact>\n\n[PLOT_THREADS]\n- NEW: <description>\n- ADVANCED: <existing thread> — <progress>\n- RESOLVED: <thread> — <resolution>\n\n[TIME]\n- <time markers, duration>\n\n[PHYSICAL_STATE]\n- <character>: <injury/healing/fatigue/power change>",
      "index": 8
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4161909,
        4161941
      ],
      "value": "你是一个事实提取专家",
      "index": 9
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4161941,
        4162009
      ],
      "value": "阅读章节正文，提取每一个可观察到的事实变化。",
      "index": 10
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4162009,
        4162633
      ],
      "value": "## 提取类别\n\n1. **角色行为**：谁做了什么，对谁，为什么\n2. **位置变化**：谁去了哪里，从哪里来\n3. **资源变化**：获得、失去、消耗了什么，具体数量\n4. **关系变化**：新相遇、信任/不信任转变、结盟、背叛\n5. **情绪变化**：角色情绪从X到Y，触发事件是什么\n6. **信息流动**：谁知道了什么新信息，谁仍然不知情\n7. **剧情线索**：新埋下的悬念、已有线索的推进、线索的解答\n8. **时间推进**：过了多少时间，提到的时间标记\n9. **身体状态**：受伤、恢复、疲劳、战力变化",
      "index": 11
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4162633,
        4162897
      ],
      "value": "## 规则\n\n- 只从正文提取——不推测可能发生的事\n- 宁多勿少：不确定是否重要时也要记录\n- 具体化：\"陆承烬左肩旧伤开裂\" 而非 \"陆承烬受伤了\"\n- 记录章节内的时间标记\n- 标注每个场景中在场的角色",
      "index": 12
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4162897,
        4163524
      ],
      "value": "=== OBSERVATIONS ===\n\n[角色行为]\n- <角色名>: <行为/状态变化> (场景: <地点>)\n\n[位置变化]\n- <角色> 从 <A> 到 <B>\n\n[资源变化]\n- <角色> 获得/失去 <物品> (数量: <n>)\n\n[关系变化]\n- <角色A> → <角色B>: <变化描述>\n\n[情绪变化]\n- <角色>: <之前> → <之后> (触发: <事件>)\n\n[信息流动]\n- <角色> 得知: <事实> (来源: <途径>)\n- <角色> 仍不知: <事实>\n\n[剧情线索]\n- 新埋: <描述>\n- 推进: <已有线索> — <进展>\n- 回收: <线索> — <解答>\n\n[时间]\n- <时间标记、时长>\n\n[身体状态]\n- <角色>: <受伤/恢复/疲劳/战力变化>",
      "index": 13
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163524,
        4163529
      ],
      "value": "。",
      "index": 14
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163529,
        4163533
      ],
      "value": "\n\n",
      "index": 15
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163533,
        4163554
      ],
      "value": "\n\n## 输出格式\n\n",
      "index": 16
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163554,
        4163587
      ],
      "value": "Extract all facts from Chapter ",
      "index": 17
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163587,
        4163591
      ],
      "value": " \"",
      "index": 18
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
      "fileRange": [
        4163591,
        4163597
      ],
      "value": "\":\n\n",
      "index": 19
    },
    {
      "tag": "u",
